    "detailed_description": "<strong>Lair of Torment</strong> is a short indie first-person puzzle horror game in the walking simulator genre.<br><br><strong>Description</strong>.<br>Deep underground there is an asylum, in the dark and damp corridors of which an atmosphere of fear and terror reigns.<br>There, in the darkness and silence, the walls whisper secret stories, and impenetrable curtains between reality and nightmares create an atmosphere of tension and mystery.<br>However, despite all the dangers, the protagonist dares to enter the terrifying asylum, to find answers to his questions and destroy the evil that dwells there.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong>.<br>You will have to visit a frightening place where there has been no light for a long time. Beautiful graphics and high quality 3D sound will help you to fully experience the atmosphere of the game.<br><br><strong>Warning!</strong>.<br>The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Lair of Torment</strong> is a short indie first-person puzzle horror game in the walking simulator genre.<br><br><strong>Description</strong>.<br>Deep underground there is an asylum, in the dark and damp corridors of which an atmosphere of fear and terror reigns.<br>There, in the darkness and silence, the walls whisper secret stories, and impenetrable curtains between reality and nightmares create an atmosphere of tension and mystery.<br>However, despite all the dangers, the protagonist dares to enter the terrifying asylum, to find answers to his questions and destroy the evil that dwells there.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong>.<br>You will have to visit a frightening place where there has been no light for a long time. Beautiful graphics and high quality 3D sound will help you to fully experience the atmosphere of the game.<br><br><strong>Warning!</strong>.<br>The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.",
    "short_description": "This is an indie horror game with first-person puzzles. Terror and fear have enveloped the city. The maniac has returned. You sneak into his lair to try and stop him before he goes too far...",
